  "description": "<p>Rothco's PVC US Flag Patch is a versatile and durable tactical accessory perfect for adding a patriotic touch to your uniform, gear, or bag. Measuring 1 7/8 inches x 3 3/8 inches, this American flag patch features a black and white color scheme, offering a sleek and rugged look. The patch is equipped with a hook back, allowing for quick and easy attachment to any loop field, making it ideal for use on uniform sleeves, tactical bags, or hats. Constructed from high-quality PVC material, this uniform patch is designed for long-lasting wear, ensuring it can withstand the rigors of daily use. Whether you're looking to personalize your gear or display your American spirit, our PVC US Flag Patch is the perfect addition to your collection. Patches with item numbers starting with 'P' come individually packaged with a header card.</p>",
